* Risk of a Zama\nconfidential Morpho vault
** Structure
*** cAsset and cShare (ERC-7984)
*** Deposit and redeem batchers, daily
*** Zama decryption (KMS)
** Losses
*** Bad debt lowers the share price
*** Confidential shares lose pro rata
** Holders
*** cShare is a pool, not one holder
*** Skip it as representative depositor
*** Not a fast holder in a run
** Exits
*** Batch: up to a day, no slippage bound
*** Instant: minutes, amount public
*** Neither beats a NAV markdown by batch
left side
** Contagion
*** Through markets: computed as usual
*** Through Zama: common-mode
*** A freeze costs time, not value
** Probabilities
*** No history for the Zama layer
*** Breakeven p* frames the decision
** Monitoring
*** Daily redeem total is public
*** Instant exits, canceled batches
*** Pauses, upgrades, owner changes
